---
import bookcover_new from '../assets/book_cover_new.png'
---
<section id="about" class="about-section">
  
  <div class="split">
    <img src={bookcover_new.src} class="outline" alt="book cover">
    
    <div class="about-text-block">
      <h3>Improve Your Mindset, Elevate Your Results.</h3>
      <p class="intro-phrase">Harness and develop your innate ability to:</p>
      
      <ul class="values-list">
        <li>Respond to challenges and difficulty in a positive and productive manner.</li>
        <li>Lead yourself and others effectively and compassionately.</li>
        <li>Enjoy meaningful and fulfilling relationships.</li>
        <li>Live a life that is reflective of your deepest values.</li>
      </ul>
      
      <p class="blueprint-p">All of us have far more influence than we routinely realize. The <em>Art of True Advantage</em> is the blueprint for becoming more effective at using the influence we have to craft the life we deeply want to lead.</p>
      
      <h3 class="footer">Internal Orientation Drives Outcomes.</h3>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 60px 20px; 
    background-color: #f8f3df;
    scroll-margin-top: 80px;

  }

  .split {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    flex-direction: row;
    max-width: 1100px;
    width: 100%;
    gap: 60px; 
  }

  .outline {
    max-width: 320px;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border: 1px solid;
    border-image-source: linear-gradient(135deg, #d78941, #8e5a2b);
    border-image-slice: 1;
    box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
  }

  .about-text-block {
    max-width: 650px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .about-text-block h3 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    margin: 0 0 25px 0;
  }

  .intro-phrase {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    color: #4a4a4a;
  }

  .values-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 35px 0;
  }

  .values-list li {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 25px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333333;
  }

  .values-list li::before {
    content: "→";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #d78941;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  .blueprint-p {
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #222222;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .footer {
    padding-top: 1em;
  }

  /* Mobile Responsive overrides */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .outline {
    max-width: 250px; /* Slightly smaller book cover for better mobile proportions */
  }
  .split {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;    /* Centers the image and text block container horizontally */
    text-align: center;     /* Centers all standard text inline */
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .outline {
    max-width: 260px;       /* Slightly smaller book cover for better mobile proportions */
  }

  .about-text-block {
    width: 100%;
    align-items: center;    /* Ensures nested flex items align to center */
  }

  /* Shrinks the titles so they snap cleanly onto a single line */
  .about-text-block h3, 
  .about-text-block .footer {
    font-size: 1.2rem !important; 
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
    white-space: normal;    /* Fallback protection */
  }

  /* Centers the list block while keeping the text left-aligned for readability */
  .values-list {
    text-align: left;
    display: inline-block;  /* Shrinks container to content width so it can be centered */
    max-width: 90%;         /* Prevents it from hugging the screen edges */
    margin: 0 auto 30px auto; 
    padding: 0;
  }

  .values-list li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;     /* Slightly crisper text for small viewports */
  }
}
</style>